<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 0.6 points to 739.2 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 0.6 points to 739.2 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, lost 0.6 points on Monday to 739.2 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the 10 sectoral indices rose, but losses to the heavily wighted banking sector and to the chemicals sector pulled the index down.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
